  "description": "Construction of a replacement single storey rear extension and first floor rear extension.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;The proposed first-floor rear extension by reason of its sitting, design, massing and appearance would appear as an incongruous, unsubordinate and unsympathetic development to the original dwellinghouse due to its excessive depth and width to a small mid terrace property, in addition to its hipped roof which is not in keeping with the existing property, therefore resulting in a jarring, unsympathetic and dominating extension which would not contribute positively to the character and appearance of the dwellinghouse or the appearance of the terrace as a whole and therefore does comply with Policy 53 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024) and Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
